  "steps": [
    "Heat 1 tbsp oil over medium-high. Cook onions and peppers until softened, about 15 min. Set aside.",
    "Preheat oven to 450°F. Heat remaining oil; cook steak with cumin, paprika, and chili powder until browned, 3-4 min.",
